        ":question/id": "68683bb5-6e50-58ec-b9cd-38db80945d39",
        ":question/problem": "What is $\\begin{vmatrix}-1 & -9 \\\\ -7 & -10\\end{vmatrix}$?",
        ":question/worked-solution": "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -9 \\\\ -7 & -10\\end{aligned}| & =-1\\cdot (-10)-(-9)\\cdot (-7) \\\\  & =10-63 \\\\  & =-53\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
