        ":question/problem": "Calculate $det(S)$ given that\n$S=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$det(S)=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & =|\\begin{aligned}-9 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 9\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-9)(9)-(1)(9) \\\\  & =-81-9 \\\\  & =-90.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
